%I A401258 #11 Oct 24 2026 10:19:09
%S A401258 1,6,25,225,2027,21408,232825,2632215,30400782
%N A401258 Number of free polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 11-faced Voronoi cell of the point (1/12, 3/8, 3/8) under space group Pn-3m (No. 224, origin choice 1).
%C A401258 The cell is an 11-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^4 4^4 6^3 faces) arising as the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the point (1/12, 3/8, 3/8) under space group Pn-3m (No. 224, origin choice 1); its honeycomb has 24 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 11 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to the full point-symmetry group of the honeycomb (translations, rotations and improper maps).
%C A401258 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 48 modulo lattice translations (24 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A401258 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%H A401258 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">plesiohedron-census: certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search (code, certificates, catalog)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A401258 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
%o A401258 (C++) // See A401256.
%Y A401258 Cf. A398957, A398958, A398959 (Josehedron polyforms, same enumerator); A385028, A397707-A397709 (polyforms on other space-filler honeycombs); A400457-A400461, A401255 (polyforms on two further space-filling cells, same enumerator).
%Y A401258 Cf. A401256 (fixed), A401257 (one-sided).
